  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting women&#x2019;s groups in Ermera and Manufahi Districts to improve coffee and coconut oil product</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A small grant from CAFOD has been used to purchase three water pumps (and materials for building three latrines) and machines for processing the coffee and coconut.  CAFOD&#x2019;s local partner is also helping the women&#x2019;s groups improve their bookkeeping, packaging and labelling.</narrative>
